{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LEV","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"利未记","commonName":"利未记","title":"利未记","order":3,"numberOfChapters":27,"sha256":"abbbb926c1738f9da414cb45cd4d355517a03ac1f9d5f16d4bb017234cba6bbc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":27,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/27.json","totalNumberOfVerses":856},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["产妇洁净的条例"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“你把以下条例告诉以色列人。 “如果有妇人生了男婴，她就要不洁净七天，像在经期内不洁净一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["第八天，婴儿要接受割礼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["妇人因产后流血，要等三十三天才能洁净。其间，不可接触任何圣物，也不可进入圣所。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["如果妇人生的是女婴，她就要不洁净十四天，像在经期内不洁净一样。她因产后流血，要等六十六天才能洁净。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["她不论生男生女，洁净期满后，都要预备一只一岁的羊羔作燔祭、一只雏鸽或斑鸠作赎罪祭，带到会幕门口交给祭司。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["祭司要在耶和华面前献祭，为她赎罪，她的流血状况才算洁净。这是有关产妇生男生女的条例。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["她若负担不起一只羊羔，可以带两只斑鸠或雏鸽来，一只作燔祭，一只作赎罪祭。祭司为她赎罪后，她就洁净了。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/LEV/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}